# Line-ending policy.
#
# Only file types where CRLF actively breaks a build or tool are pinned to LF.
# The repository already contains ~160 CRLF files (mostly Flutter/Android/iOS
# scaffold and SQL/docs), so those extensions are deliberately NOT pinned here:
# adding a rule would renormalise them on the next checkout and bury real
# changes in whole-file diffs. Fix those separately if desired.
#
# `* text=auto` alone lets git detect and normalise on commit without forcing
# a specific EOL on files that are already stored as-is.

* text=auto

# Go
*.go   text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf

# Shell scripts
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf

# Build files we own (already LF; pinned so they stay that way)
Dockerfile   text eol=lf
*.dockerfile text eol=lf
Makefile     text eol=lf
*.mk         text eol=lf

# Never rewrite binary assets
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
